ogical material. The collection ranges from Siracusa and the surrounding territory (Megara Hyblaia, Akrai, Kasmenai etc) to encompass all of eastern Sicily, reaching as far as Gela and Agrigento. The ground floor covers prehistory through to the end of the Classical period. Upstairs includes Hellenistic and Roman Syracuse and a display of material from the catacombs. A gallery displaying material from Hellenistic eastern Sicily is in preparation.",{"settlement":78,"region":78,"country":117,"address":118,"geo":119},"Italy","Viale Teocrito 66, 96100 - Siracusa",{"lat":120,"lon":121},37.07636989,15.2866213,{"_":123,"type":124},"107482","inventory",{"_":126,"mainLang":127,"languages":128},"Latin","la",[126],{"type":130,"bibl":131},"edition",[17],{"type":133,"bibl":134},"discussion",[17],{"editor":136,"principal":139,"contributors":140,"change":144},{"_":137,"ref":138},"Jonathan Prag","#JP",{"_":137,"ref":138},[141],{"_":137,"xml:id":142,"ref":143},"JP","http://orcid.org/0000-0003-3819-8537",{"_":145,"when":146,"who":138},"Jonathan Prag edited file based upon autopsy notes","2026-05-11","",{"n":99,"url":100,"height":101,"width":102,"desc":103,"surfaceType":104},[150],{"atLeast":151,"atMost":151},76,[],[],[155,156,157,19,25,29,158,159,160,161,159,162,163,127],"isic002138","fragment of a dedication to imperator caesar afinius gallus",{"_":5},"syracusae","siracusa","sicilia","sicily","museo archeologico regionale paolo orsi","latin",[],{"title":166,"body":167,"divs":168,"editions":193,"images":203,"handnote":214},"ISic002138. Fragment of a dedication to Imperator Caesar Afinius Gallus","\u003Cdiv id=\"editions\">\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: autopsy Flavio Santini 2018-09-14\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"la\">  \u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Ca id=\"al1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Afinio\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Afinio\">A\u003Cspan class=\"tall\" title=\"tall character: f\">f\u003C/span>inio\u003C/span>\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003C/span>\u003C/div>  \u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: autopsy Flavio Santini 2018-09-14\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"la\">\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">\u003Ca id=\"al1-diplomatic\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Afinio\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Afinio\">A\u003Cspan class=\"tall\" title=\"tall character: f\">F\u003C/span>INIO\u003C/span>\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"facsimile-images\">\u003Ch2>Facsimile Images\u003C/h2>\u003Ca href=\"ISic002138_tiled.tif\">\u003Cimg title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2019-10-01\" src=\"ISic002138_tiled-thumb.tif\">\u003C/a>\u003Ca href=\"ISic002138.jpg\">\u003Cimg title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2019-10-01\" src=\"ISic002138-thumb.jpg\">\u003C/a>\u003Ca href=\"ISic002138_rear_tiled.tif\">\u003Cimg title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2019-10-01\" src=\"ISic002138_rear_tiled-thumb.tif\">\u003C/a>\u003Ca href=\"ISic002138_rear.jpg\">\u003Cimg title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2019-10-01\" src=\"ISic002138_rear-thumb.jpg\">\u003C/a>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"apparatus\">\u003Ch4>Apparatus criticus\u003C/h4>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan>\u003Cspan>Text from autopsy\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"translation\">\u003Ch2>English translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">\u003Ca href=\"http://orcid.org/0000-0003-3819-8537\">Jonathan Prag\u003C/a>\u003C/p>  \u003Cp>[---] for Afinius [---]\u003C/p>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"commentary\">\u003Ch2>commentary\u003C/h2>  \u003Cp>The fragments are unpublished. The name Afinius is not common, and the vast majority of texts bearing the name are set up in honour of the son of the Emperor Gallus, who was made Caesar by his father, with the full title Imperator Caesar Gaius Vibius Afinius Gallus Veldumnianus Volusianus, for the brief period June 251 to October 253. The name occasionally recurs among other private individuals (as does the rare name Safinius), but rarely and usually in funerary texts. The monumental form of this text makes it extremely likely that this is an imperial dedication for Afinius Gallus. The only other elite instance of Afinius is the consul ordinarius of 62 CE, L. Afinius Gallus, alongside Publius Marius, but the letter forms are much more obviously those of the third than the first century CE. Afinius Gallus was also honoured at Halaesa on the north coast (see \u003Ca href=\"https://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic003588\" target=\"_blank\">ISic003588\u003C/a>. Note however the funerary epitaph for Gallicanus (\u003Ca href=\"https://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic000325\" target=\"_blank\">ISic000325\u003C/a>), vilicus at a location called Afiniana, in the vicinity of Catania, perhaps reflecting property belonging to the family at an earlier date on the island.\u003C/p>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"bibliography\">\u003Ch2>bibliography\u003C/h2>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"handnote\">\u003Cp>Fine tall, narrow, v-cut letters, with elegant curved serifs, and a very extended, curved upper cross bar to the F.\u003C/p> Line 1  76  \u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence \u003C/div>",[169,172,175,178,181,184,187,190],{"id":170,"html":171},"editions","\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: autopsy Flavio Santini 2018-09-14\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"la\">  \u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Ca id=\"al1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Afinio\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Afinio\">A\u003Cspan class=\"tall\" title=\"tall character: f\">f\u003C/span>inio\u003C/span>\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003C/span>\u003C/div>  \u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: autopsy Flavio Santini 2018-09-14\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"la\">\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">\u003Ca id=\"al1-diplomatic\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Afinio\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Afinio\">A\u003Cspan class=\"tall\" title=\"tall character: f\">F\u003C/span>INIO\u003C/span>\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>",{"id":173,"html":174},"facsimile-images","\u003Ch2>Facsimile Images\u003C/h2>\u003Ca href=\"ISic002138_tiled.tif\">\u003Cimg title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2019-10-01\" src=\"ISic002138_tiled-thumb.tif\">\u003C/a>\u003Ca href=\"ISic002138.jpg\">\u003Cimg title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2019-10-01\" src=\"ISic002138-thumb.jpg\">\u003C/a>\u003Ca href=\"ISic002138_rear_tiled.tif\">\u003Cimg title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2019-10-01\" src=\"ISic002138_rear_tiled-thumb.tif\">\u003C/a>\u003Ca href=\"ISic002138_rear.jpg\">\u003Cimg title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2019-10-01\" src=\"ISic002138_rear-thumb.jpg\">\u003C/a>",{"id":176,"html":177},"apparatus","\u003Ch4>Apparatus criticus\u003C/h4>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan>\u003Cspan>Text from autopsy\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>",{"id":179,"html":180},"translation","\u003Ch2>English translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">\u003Ca href=\"http://orcid.org/0000-0003-3819-8537\">Jonathan Prag\u003C/a>\u003C/p>  \u003Cp>[---] for Afinius [---]\u0